@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = {{authToken}}
@guardianId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Canonical guardian search/list route
GET {{baseUrl}}/students-guardians/guardians?search=fda
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Legacy guardian search/list route - should not hit students/:studentId UUID parser
GET {{baseUrl}}/students-guardians/students/guardians?search=fda
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Canonical get guardian
GET {{baseUrl}}/students-guardians/guardians/{{guardianId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Legacy get guardian
GET {{baseUrl}}/students-guardians/students/guardians/{{guardianId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Canonical guardian students
GET {{baseUrl}}/students-guardians/guardians/{{guardianId}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Canonical create/link guardian account
POST {{baseUrl}}/students-guardians/guardians/{{guardianId}}/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "create",
  "username": "guardian.demo",
  "fullName": "Guardian Demo",
  "generatePassword": true,
  "temporaryPasswordMode": true
}

### Student dynamic route should still reject non-UUID normally
GET {{baseUrl}}/students-guardians/students/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
